## Table of contents entry
A surfactant-assisted solution synthesis toward ultrathin large-sized 2D conjugated MOF nanosheets (NSs) is explored. Benefiting from the ultrathin feature, the synthetic NSs allow fast ion diffusion and high utilization of active sites, and therefore exhibit remarkable performance for Li-ion batteries, superior to the corresponding bulk materials and other reported MOF cathodes.
